From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scissors <noreply@scissorsmc.github.io>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 12:12:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Sanitize area effect cloud particles

Area-effect clouds make clients construct particles proportional to squared radius before queue limits apply. Restrict clouds to vanilla particle implementations and bound radius, active duration, wait time, and loaded age so custom particles or long-lived clouds cannot create unbounded client work.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/AreaEffectCloud.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/AreaEffectCloud.java
index f03fa06c0ba56f7f5e1e45bc1568a490751efde3..792fa8e09ecfd244d289e1e12c5edc41895e0f0a 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/AreaEffectCloud.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/AreaEffectCloud.java
@@ -1,15 +1,20 @@
